          "start_ms": null,
          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Summary: Nighttime observation of a light moving along a ridge, first red then white: observation of 3 wingsuit parachutists who performed a nighttime jump from the Aiguille de Varan (Haute-Savoie) using lights inside their suits (white lights) and fume bombs (red color).",
